# Sites the ISP blocks (DNS sinkhole + SNI reset) that go through WARP — one domain per line.
# A line covers the domain and every sub-domain ("missav.ws" also covers "www.missav.ws").
# Used by BOTH the proxy (anything else is refused, 403) and Brave (WARP)'s PAC file (anything
# else goes direct), so no other traffic can ever reach WARP through this path.
# Edit ~/.config/warp-doh-proxy/hosts — setup-app.sh never overwrites it.
missav.com
missav.ai
missav.ws
missav.live
123av.com
123av.ai
123av.ws
javxx.com
njavtv.com
# HLS CDN of the sites above (reachable directly, but listed so a clearance tied to the WARP IP still works)
surrit.com
